<div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
  <h1 style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 40%, var(--accent-secondary) 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;">Contact & Support</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 800px; margin-bottom: 0;">
    Connect with the project maintainers, request new data types, or report issues.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="grid">
  <div class="card">
    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--accent-secondary);">Request a New Semantic Type</h3>
    <p class="card-description">
      Are you missing a standard identifier, medical clinical classification, or geodata scope? You can submit a request on our tracker.
    </p>
    <a href="https://github.com/DataArtifex/dartfx-semanticdt/issues/new?title=Request:+New+Semantic+Type&body=Describe+the+semantic+type,+its+validation+rules,+and+use+cases." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: auto;">Request Type &rarr;</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--accent-secondary);">Report a Bug or Issue</h3>
    <p class="card-description">
      Found an error in a validation pattern, code snippet, or display template? Submit a bug report to help improve the library.
    </p>
    <a href="https://github.com/DataArtifex/dartfx-semanticdt/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: auto;">Open Tracker &rarr;</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--accent-secondary);">Contribute Code & Schemas</h3>
    <p class="card-description">
      Want to add an SDT yourself? View our development guides to see how to contribute directly.
    </p>
    <a href="https://github.com/DataArtifex/dartfx-semanticdt/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: auto;">Contributor Guide &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="card" style="margin-top: 2rem; padding: 2rem;">
  <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">Maintainer Information</h3>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
    The Semantic Data Type project is open source and maintained under the umbrella of <a href="https://dataartifex.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Data Artifex</strong></a>.
    For other inquiries, please open an issue in the primary repository or contact us at <a href="mailto:[EMAIL_ADDRESS]">[EMAIL_ADDRESS]</a>.
  </p>
</div>
